{"version":1,"content":"<p>「香港網球一哥」黃澤林與陳奕迅女兒康堤結束半年戀情後，近日因與譚旻萱（Mandy）在廣州南沙球場上舉止親暱，惹來「無縫接軌」之說。</p><p>他日前致電JFFT成員床哥的網上直播節目，首度交代分手及新戀情的時間線。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:04.809743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:27:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:27.181382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:04.809743+00:00","content_hash":"792d8bd66945364d84125f49b3aec568dba9ade63bc66e246f3ee5942105a260","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}